{"text": "Ichabod lived with the families of his students, staying a week at each house in turn. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> He helped with the farm work, taught singing on Sundays, and was popular with the women of the valley. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> He loved ghost stories, and on winter evenings he listened to the old wives tales until he trembled. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Walking home in the dark afterward, he jumped at every shadow and sang loudly to keep up his courage. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Among his singing students was Katrina Van Tassel, the only daughter of a very rich Dutch farmer. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> She was eighteen, with rosy cheeks, and she was famous for both her beauty and her fathers money. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> When Ichabod saw the fat pigs, turkeys, and wide fields of the Van Tassel farm, his eyes shone. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> If I married Katrina, all of this would be mine, he thought, picturing every pig as a roast dinner. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> But Ichabod had a rival, Brom Bones, the strongest young man in the valley and its best horseman. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Brom loved pranks, and whenever his horse was tied at the Van Tassels fence, other young men stayed away.", "alignment": {"characters": ["I", "c", "h", "a", "b", "o", "d", " ", "l", "i", "v", "e", "d", " ", "w", "i", "t", "h", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "f", "a", "m", "i", "l", "i", "e", "s", " ", "o", "f", " ", "h", "i", "s", " ", "s", "t", "u", "d", "e", "n", "t", "s", ",", " ", "s", "t", "a", "y", "i", "n", "g", " ", "a", " ", "w", "e", "e", "k", " ", "a", "t", " ", "e", "a", "c", "h", " ", "h", "o", "u", "s", "e", " ", "i", "n", " ", "t", "u", "r", "n", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "H", "e", " ", "h", "e", "l", "p", "e", "d", " ", "w", "i", "t", "h", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "f", "a", "r", "m", " ", "w", "o", "r", "k", ",", " ", "t", "a", "u", "g", "h", "t", " ", "s", "i", "n", "g", "i